- OSAP - MDGs quick wins contractor 2008 intervention.<br /><p>
- Nasarawa state Health Development Project II contractor for water supply<br />
<br /><p>
- Nasarawa state university, faculty of Agriculture water supply schem. 2007
<br /><p>
- College of Agriculture, Lafia water supply scheme.2007<br />
<br />
- Nasarawa state Government 2009 Rural water scheme: construction of: &nbsp; &nbsp; <br />
  &nbsp; &nbsp;50 New hand-pump boreholes<br />
  &nbsp;&nbsp; On-going rehabilitation of 39 dysfunctional boreholes<br />
<br /><p>
- 400 Private / individual, corporate organisation jobs:<br />
  Borehole drilling, rehabilitations, spring development<br />
<br /><p>
- ongoing 53 numbers of solar powered boreholes for Nasarawa state under the 2008 MDGs-CGS PHCs.<br />
<br/><p>
- Provision of borehole water suplly scheme, overhead reservoir and reticulation at Nasarawa State Secretariat, Jos Road, Bukan Sidi, Lafia<br />
<br /><p>
